# Local File Storage Directory

This directory stores uploaded media files organized by:
- username/images/ - Image files (jpg, png, gif, etc.)
- username/videos/ - Video files (mp4, avi, mov, etc.)  
- username/files/ - Other files (documents, audio, etc.)

Directory structure example:
```
buckets/
├── admin/
│   ├── images/
│   │   ├── uuid1.jpg
│   │   └── uuid2.png
│   ├── videos/
│   │   └── uuid3.mp4
│   └── files/
│       └── uuid4.pdf
└── user2/
    ├── images/
    ├── videos/
    └── files/
```

Note: This directory is created automatically when users upload files.
